      "side": 1,
      "message": "If a device is RKP-only, it will have the rkp-only property set; however, this property is cleared when running a test under GSI.  \n\nIn that configuration (RKP-only device being tested under GSI), the device has no batch keys and so cannot perform attestation without using an `ATTEST_KEY` to sign the leaf certificate.  So your change will make all attestation tests fail in that scenario.",
